# Autosave and crash recovery, launch 3 of 4: offered again after Escape;
# this time Restore. The layer comes back with its edit pending, and the
# view zooms to its data. The script then crashes again, to show that the
# restored layer is already safe in this run's autosave.
# See autosave-1-edit-and-crash.osmscript for how to run the four launches.

window 1200 800
viewport 40.7120 -74.0060 12
wait 1500ms
assert_dialog restore

restore_autosave
assert_dialog none
assert_pending 1
assert_autosave_exists 1
wait_idle 3s
capture out/autosave-04-restored.png

log restored and carried over; crashing again
crash
